{
  "about": "One short plain name per parameter: the device's help line (builder item PARAM_HELP) and the web editor's tooltips. tools/gen_param_help.py makes the firmware header and the editor's copy; tests/param_help_ui.c checks every value a knob reaches has its line and that it fits the top bar (232 px, 29 characters of the UI font). kind page: a page title (params.c PAGES) or a live screen, its values by label, or by knob (slots) where the page has no descriptors; eng: an engine's EDIT values by engine name; fm6: the FM6 operator editor's pages. if: the C condition the lines compile under (their feature); 0: the web editor's own controls only (LEVEL, BYPASS).",
